  "Id": 2420,
  "Title": "AKU-ISMC Alumni  Set Up \"Be-khudi\"",
  "NewsSubTitle": "A New Platform for Meditation and Mindfulness",
  "NewsSummary": "AKU-ISMC's alumni set up a platform for meditation in English and Urdu.",
  "GlobalNews": false,
  "AlternateNewsTitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSubtitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSummary": null,
  "NewsContent": "<div class=\"ExternalClass32C6FCCB315142CD8BE9449C8C782A8E\"><p></p><p>In these complicated times, more and more people are looking online to help them find a sense of calm and wellbeing.&#160;AKU-ISMC alumni, Tehmina Mansoor and Zohaib Zuby&#160;have&#160;responded to this by setting up a platform sharing guided meditations in Urdu and English. <a href=\"https&#58;//www.youtube.com/watch?v=GwRl4KpDoVI\" target=\"_blank\">Be-khudi </a>combines wisdom from their native South Asia with the discipline of Mindfulness and is the first platform to offer meditations in both languages.&#160;Tehmina explains how Be-khudi is developing during the pandemic; \"We launched in January of this year right before lockdown and posted our free Urdu and English Meditations as an album.\"</p><div>As lockdown continued Tehmina started receiving requests for more support.&#160;This led to the creation of a new meditation - specially addressing the frightening effects of the pandemic; the &quot;<a href=\"https&#58;//www.youtube.com/watch?v=3R51ZrX0eMY&amp;t=142s\" target=\"_blank\">Mindful Conversation</a>&quot; series which launched in July and is especially aimed at people feeling affected by the post-covid life.&#160;Tehmina adds; \"Most of the people registering wrote about having trouble in their new post-covid life. Some are having a problem with routine, some have a problem with managing children; and so on. This is a free service, just like all the meditations we have posted online. We have since gotten a very good response.\"</div><div><br><br></div><p><br></p></div>",
